DESCRIPTION:Halloween Ornaments & “Poison” Bottle Factory from 12:30 to
  2 p.m.\nPaynetown SRA\, Activity Center (Shelter & Patio)\nDROP BY to cre
 ate a unique Halloween ornament by transforming wood slices into ghosts\, 
 pumpkins\, and monsters – then join the assembly line and construct your
  own “poison” bottle – the perfect place to store potion ingredients
  or mysterious tiny treasures.
